  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Volunteers (UNV) programme is a UN organization contributinig to peace and development through volunteerism. UNV mobilizes more than 7,500 UNV volunteers every year. More than 75% of UNV volunteers come from developing countries, and more than 30% volunteer within their own countries. Sida contributes 4 MSEK/year as core-funding to the SVF.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNV &#xE4;r en FN-organisation som bidrar till fred och utveckling genom volont&#xE4;rverksamhet. UNV mobiliserar mer &#xE4;n 7 500 volont&#xE4;rer varje &#xE5;r. Mer &#xE4;n 75% av volont&#xE4;rerna kommer fr&#xE5;n utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder, och mer &#xE4;n 30% vutf&#xF6;r volont&#xE4;rarbete i sina egna l&#xE4;nder. Sida bidrar med 4 MSEK/&#xE5;r som core-funding till UNVs fond SVF.</narrative>
  </description>
